sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Portal
    participant MgmtAPI as Management API
    participant DB as BRaVe DB
    participant Elastic as Elastic Cloud
    participant SB as Azure Service Bus (Queue)
    participant Dedupe as Deduplication Service
    participant Match as Matching Server

    %% Data update flow
    Portal->>MgmtAPI: Create / Update data
    MgmtAPI->>DB: Write / Update records
    MgmtAPI->>Elastic: Index / Update search documents
    MgmtAPI-->>SB: Publish job message (biometric dedupe needed)

    %% Async deduplication flow
    Dedupe->>SB: Dequeue job message
    Dedupe->>DB: Fetch biometric data
    Dedupe->>Match: Send biometric payload for duplication check
    Match-->>Dedupe: Match result (scores / duplicates)
    Dedupe->>DB: Update dedupe results & status

    %% Search flow
    Portal->>MgmtAPI: Search request
    MgmtAPI->>Elastic: Execute search query
    Elastic-->>MgmtAPI: Search results
    MgmtAPI-->>Portal: Search response
